        },
        {
          "text": " Ido iboikinos akwap nakolo ainakini Yakob ekabulesit, naeboienenoto lukapapaakus; aso iboikinos nen, kes ka ikeeedwe, ka idwe luka idwekec, ikar kere: Daudi da ekabulesit ŋes eraenena ekapolonikee ikar kerc. ",
